[Desktop Entry]
Type=Service
Name=Kinefin
Name[it]=Kinefin
Comment=Find movies and shows on your Jellyfin server while Kinefin is open; what you type is sent to that server
Comment[it]=Trova film e serie TV sul tuo server Jellyfin mentre Kinefin è aperto; quello che digiti viene inviato a quel server
Icon=io.github.the_beper.Kinefin
X-KDE-PluginInfo-Name=io.github.the_beper.Kinefin
X-KDE-PluginInfo-EnabledByDefault=false
X-Plasma-API=DBus
X-Plasma-DBusRunner-Service=io.github.the_beper.Kinefin.Runner*
X-Plasma-DBusRunner-Path=/runner
X-Plasma-Request-Actions-Once=true
X-Plasma-Runner-Min-Letter-Count=3
X-Plasma-Runner-Syntaxes=:q:
X-Plasma-Runner-Syntax-Descriptions=Finds movies, series, episodes and collections on your Jellyfin server whose name matches :q:
X-Plasma-Runner-Syntax-Descriptions[it]=Trova film, serie, episodi e raccolte sul tuo server Jellyfin il cui nome corrisponde a :q:
